  "title": "Easy Cheesy Potatoes",
  "description": "Sliced potatoes, green peppers, onions, and a dab of butter are sealed in aluminum foil and tossed onto the grill. When the veggies are piping hot and tender, sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and serve.",
  "authors": [
    "SHOTZY"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-08-07T10:23:02-04:00",
